porting information</strong><p id="serviceRequirements">Select a service to view the requirements.</p><span>For a permit application, attach the documents listed. For complaints, photographs or other evidence are optional. This form is not an emergency response channel.</span></div><?php file_field();if($r){$n=(int)value('SELECT COUNT(*) FROM attachments WHERE request_id=?',[$id]);echo '<p class="small muted">'.$n.' existing document(s) will be retained.</p>';}?><label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="confirmation" value="1" required> I confirm that the information is accurate and that I am authorised to submit these documents.</label><div class="actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" name="intent" value="submit" type="submit">Submit request <?=icon('arrow')?></button><button class="btn btn-outline" name="intent" value="draft" type="submit">Save draft</button><a href="<?=e(url('requests'))?>" class="small">Cancel</a></div></form></section><div class="stack"><section class="panel panel-body"><span class="service-icon"><?=icon('building')?></span><h3>What happens next?</h3><ol class="checklist"><li>Your submission receives a unique reference and private tracking code.</li><li>The selected service routes it to the responsible department.</li><li>An available departmental officer is assigned automatically where possible.</li><li>The officer reviews your documents, asks for details or records a decision.</li></ol><p class="small muted">Saved drafts are not sent for review and do not receive service deadlines until submitted.</p></section><div class="notice">Published charges are provided by the responsible authority. Payments are not collected through this portal.</div></div></div><?php page_end();
}
